{"cases":[{"attack":true,"case":"The proposed discriminator is self-defeating under its own mechanism. It claims mere checklist-tracking yields independent, item-local errors, but any checklist whose under-specification is itself systematic (e.g., omits an entire cognitive primitive) produces exactly the correlated degradation by latent subtask structure that the test uses to identify 'genuine reliability.' Thus an incomplete-but-systematic checklist mimics the signature of competence, and the test cannot distinguish a genuine panel from a panel that merely complies with a systematically incomplete checklist.","counterexample":["A checklist for radiology triage that omits a subtle primitive (e.g., recognizing early effusion). Panel errors correlate across all effusion-present subtasks because every panelist follows the same deficient checklist, producing correlated degradation by latent structure — the exact pattern SRC_001 attributes to genuine reliability."],"target":"4dea6aae3c21bf58b0e36e44298d8a8681ee5c4119b7f14c83202c78f13afb90"},{"attack":true,"case":"SRC_002's smoothness discriminator is defeated by a checklist whose thresholds are themselves graded or item-difficulty-dependent. It assumes mere compliance is binary pass/fail per item, but a well-engineered checklist can encode confidence tiers or adjust its decision threshold by item features. In that case compliant panel errors near the boundary follow a smooth gradient as item difficulty varies, making mere compliance indistinguishable from genuine reliability by the proposed test.","counterexample":["A triage checklist instructs: mark 'refer' if ≥3 of 5 signs present. As item difficulty varies continuously (probability of a correct 'refer' decision), the panel's error rate rises smoothly near the 3-sign boundary even under pure mechanical compliance, producing the smooth gradient SRC_002 treats as evidence of genuine competence."],"target":"7861ea18ee518cbd0b42e71782436009a159d77e977f776bece35612e5175747"},{"attack":false,"case":"","target":"f12b6e32565fb454ec4bab569fc7e88099ac503ef0a5adbb612a10439f7f41f5"}]}